{"type":"TEXT","ticket":927,"id":"e925"}||{"partId":"","groupId":"","locked":false,"zIndex":925,"x":1200,"y":347.22222,"rotation":0,"value":"--------------------------------------------------------------------\n店铺：深圳市优信电子\n物料约30元，满6.6包邮\n \nTP4054线性锂离子电池充电器芯片(每套需1个，建议买3个以上)：\nhttps://m.tb.cn/h.5DUGVWWOZYhLHpf?tk=a5dUWMV6ftw\n \n0603贴片电阻 47KΩ：\nhttps://m.tb.cn/h.5xAMxJf34xIQ2Ex?tk=5FYRWMVgne0\n \n0603贴片电阻 5.1KΩ：\nhttps://m.tb.cn/h.5xALZ6zTC2iHZ2t?tk=ZFb9WMV6H5g\n \n0603贴片电阻 2.7KΩ：\nhttps://m.tb.cn/h.5DGMKswInHOBmgn?tk=glxWWMVhbRC \n \n0603贴片电阻 1KΩ：\nhttps://m.tb.cn/h.5CTeWSo7y47jjiI?tk=mF3FWoKGZau\n \n1206贴片电阻 3.3Ω：\nhttps://m.tb.cn/h.5DGnNDyKV2oSZt1?tk=UOwJWMVgYXm\n \n0603贴片电容 50V 10NF：\nhttps://m.tb.cn/h.5xAM8ar7CNCFFZ3?tk=ch4lWMV5bIc\n \n0603贴片电容50V 100NF（0.1UF) ：\nhttps://m.tb.cn/h.5DGNRYJyVWXu2ez?tk=4gxhWMV5cOh\n \n0603贴片电容10V 4.7UF：\nhttps://m.tb.cn/h.5DGo6Jg1bhEjwQv?tk=mXf0WMVgmcN\n \n0603贴片电容 10V 10UF：\nhttps://m.tb.cn/h.5DUHVii1qE158zk?tk=hCLvWMVTW4u\n \n1206贴片电容 50V 10UF：\nhttps://m.tb.cn/h.5xU3lJw4pIqPjd8?tk=WcWEWMVgYDu\n \n贴片铝电解电容 10V 100UF 体积 5*5.4MM(每套需1个，建议买3个以上)：\nhttps://m.tb.cn/h.5xU359JCwyrBvTc?tk=Gw2yWMVTNpt\n \n0420 一体成型 贴片 功率电感 6.8UH(每套需1个，建议买3个以上)：\nhttps://m.tb.cn/h.5DGMxOtXcrJNR87?tk=DppsWMVg7DM\n \nDSK36贴片肖特基二极管：\nhttps://m.tb.cn/h.5DUsotlL2PUeXoK?tk=oNlSWMVTMzG\n \nDSK34贴片肖特基二极管：\nhttps://m.tb.cn/h.5xALC5yvDtdEAw4?tk=g05yWMVgcfO\n \nSMFJ6.0CA贴片TVS瞬变抑制二极管 6V/双向(每套需2个，建议买4个以上)：\nhttps://m.tb.cn/h.5DGoPfWUMlYOKsL?tk=BzWDWMVTTR9\n \n0805贴片LED灯 红色：\nhttps://m.tb.cn/h.5xAovqMRXbiagXl?tk=EiobWMVTLEK\n \nAO3401A P沟道 贴片MOSFET场效应管：\nhttps://m.tb.cn/h.5DUtXvHPIdM88bv?tk=TtOuWMVgxLW\n \n0805 贴片自恢复保险丝1.1A 6V(每套需1个，建议买3个以上)：\nhttps://m.tb.cn/h.5xU3OZ8fcuvlqSg?tk=nIUhWMV67GQ","color":"#0000ff","fillColor":null,"fontFamily":"Verdana","fontSize":5.55556,"strikeout":false,"underline":false,"italic":false,"fontWeight":false,"align":"LEFT_BOTTOM","yAxisDirection":"up"}|
{"type":"TEXT","ticket":928,"id":"e926"}||{"partId":"","groupId":"","locked":false,"zIndex":926,"x":1385,"y":408.88889,"rotation":0,"value":"MSK-12C02拨动开关 贴片 7脚两档：\nhttps://m.tb.cn/h.5xUWH64S1BvucKU?tk=j4lsWMV5jgh\n \nUSB Type-C 6P母座卧贴四脚全贴(每套需1个，建议买3个以上)：\nhttps://m.tb.cn/h.5xApPye1tfROTuu?tk=IPvbWMVhkAT\n \n以下四种LED都可以使用，任选一种购买就好：\n(2835封装的便宜，3528封装的好焊接，数量根据需求选择)\n \n2835贴片LED灯 暖白光：\nhttps://m.tb.cn/h.5DUHJ6DTrLmB0iX?tk=NWhmWMVgVK6\n \n2835贴片LED灯 正白光：\nhttps://m.tb.cn/h.5xAMfAXypEwYTJT?tk=V0BKWMVgTCJ\n \n3528/1210 贴片LED灯 正白光：\nhttps://m.tb.cn/h.5xAMnKB2D8SXkoj?tk=tf5qWMVT6ll\n \n3528/1210 贴片LED灯 暖白光:\nhttps://m.tb.cn/h.5DUt0456Z2BLXd2?tk=8KEuWMVgJFl\n--------------------------------------------------------------------\n \n--------------------------------------------------------------------\n店铺：深圳市华源芯电子有限公司\n物料约2.5元，运费约2元\n \n贴片双排母2.54MM间距2*2P(每套需6个，建议买12个以上)：\nhttps://m.tb.cn/h.5DUGgE9KmDYXVHc?tk=LBUzWMV6NEw\n \n立式贴片排针2.54MM间距2*2P(每套需6个，建议买12个以上)：\nhttps://m.tb.cn/h.5DGoCRe7CADvDni?tk=JT4IWMVh6XZ\n--------------------------------------------------------------------\n \n--------------------------------------------------------------------\n店铺：深圳市博源瑞达电子\n物料约1元，运费约1元\n \nSGL8022W 触摸调光芯片(每套需1个，建议购买3个及以上)：\nhttps://m.tb.cn/h.5p4q8mNqqVj3dwM?tk=lm4hW6xW6kv\n--------------------------------------------------------------------\n \n--------------------------------------------------------------------\n店铺：深圳市锋和汇科技有限公司\n物料约3.3元，运费约2元\n \nAP3032KTR-G1升压型LED驱动芯片(每套需1个，建议购买2个及以上)：\nhttps://m.tb.cn/h.5xGVRz363Y1cCXA?tk=tfWxWoKAdZQ\n--------------------------------------------------------------------","color":"#0000ff","fillColor":null,"fontFamily":"Verdana","fontSize":5.55556,"strikeout":false,"underline":false,"italic":false,"fontWeight":false,"align":"LEFT_BOTTOM","yAxisDirection":"up"}|
